cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TEMBA, please cite it as below."
title: "TEMBA: Three-dimensional Emission Mock-models for Blind-survey Assessments"
abstract: >-
  TEMBA measures the completeness of H I source catalogues by injecting
  3D-Barolo model galaxies into a survey's own cubes, with the catalogued
  sources removed, and recovering them with the unmodified SoFiA-2
  configuration that produced the catalogue.
type: software
version: 1.0.10
date-released: 2026-10-07
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Mophahlane
    given-names: Koketso Vincent
repository-code: "https://github.com/koketso01/temba"
keywords: [radio astronomy, HI, completeness, injection-recovery, SoFiA-2, 3D-Barolo]
